<title>USA: LSB Financial Q4 net up on interest gain.</title>
<headline>LSB Financial Q4 net up on interest gain.</headline>
<dateline>LAFAYETTE, Ind. 1997-02-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>LSB Financial Corp said on Monday higher interest income helped earnings increase in the fourth quarter ended December 31.</p>
<p>The company said net income in the period reached $343,000, or $0.41 a share, up from $294,000, or $0.30 a share, one year ago. Total interest income rose to $3.5 million from $3.0 million in the fourth quarter of 1995.</p>
<p>LBS Financial is the parent of Lafayette Savings Bank FSB.</p>
<p>Its shares were trading up 1/2 Monday at 19-3/4.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
